  "sheik": [
    "Time passes, people move. The forest remembers what has changed.",
    "You learned the Minuet of Forest: J I U L U L. Play it to return to this clearing. The Hookshot can reach the branch above the ruined steps."
  ],
  "saria": [
    "The forest has been calling, Link. You have brought its light back.",
    "I am the Sage of Forest. Take the Forest Medallion and carry our promise beyond these woods. The Master Sword can now lead you back to the years you left behind."
  ],
  "sprout": [
    "The curse has lifted. Roots that slept beneath this ground can grow again. I am a new life of the Deku Tree, and Saria now guards the forest as its sage. Press E to listen.",
    "Before peace came to Hyrule, a wounded mother carried her infant into these woods. The Deku Tree sheltered her child among the Kokiri. That child was you. Press E to listen.",
    "The Kokiri remain children, but you grew because you are Hylian. The forest was your home by kindness, not by birth. Your mother's journey ended here; yours reaches far beyond these trees. Press E to listen.",
    "Saria has not forgotten the friend who left the forest. Carry her gift to the other sages. Return to the Temple of Time: the sword's pedestal still has a lesson for you."
  ]
}
